The fileaas api url.

By default, only the status evaluations run by the daemon scheduler serve
the api results from a local cache. Every other action, an operator status
first of all, reads the api again. Set the OSVC_SGCP_CACHE environment
variable to override this default whatever the action origin: `1` serves
the cached values, `0` never does, the daemon scheduler included. Any other
value is ignored, with a warning in the resource status.

A cached value is only served while younger than the cache.ttl_seconds
value from the sgcp configuration file, and a zero ttl disables the cache.